// MISUSE (must ERROR): a block setter called as a top-level node builder.
//
// `rspec` is a `_ctx`-first block setter in a module that also defines the
// `bundle` builder. Calling it as a top-level node with its own trailing
// block compiles clean but runs nothing — the diagnostic must fire and name
// the fix (`rubymod.bundle() { rspec() }`).

import rubymod

main() {
    rubymod.rspec() {
        env("X", "1")
    }
}
